    <bpmn:process id="W_W3275" name="W3275. Legal Entity Management &amp; Corporate Secretarial Support" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Entity event (new entity, amendment, dissolution); board/secretarial need; annual cycle
Frequency: Event-driven + annual
Volume: 5 legal entities (Holdings, Depot, Logistics, Digital Commerce, Property Mgmt)
Owner: Corporate Secretary
Participants: Corporate Secretary, VP Legal &amp; Compliance, Legal Ops Mgr, Finance (links to VS-17/VS-36), External Counsel
Source: workflow W3275 — Legal Entity Management &amp; Corporate Secretarial Support</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3275_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3275_Lane1" name="Corporate Secretary">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3275_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3275_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3275_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3275_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3275_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3275_Start3" name="Entity event (new entity, amendment, dissolution); board/secretarial need; annual cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3275_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3275_Task4" name="Corporate Secretary maintain entity register and statutory records: SEC…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Corporate Secretary maintain entity register and statutory records: SEC registration (Articles, By-laws, GIS per VS-36), General Information Sheet filings, board/stockholder minutes and resolutions (links to VS-36.1), officer/director register, permits/licenses (links to VS-22.1), foreign-investment filings where applicable
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary / Legal Ops Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3275_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3275_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3275_Task5" name="Manage entity events: incorporation, amendment of articles, change of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage entity events: incorporation, amendment of articles, change of officers/directors, increase/decrease in capital, mergers/dissolutions, name change; coordinate SEC filings and LGU/BIR updates (links to VS-76/VS-79); maintain corporate calendar
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary / External Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3275_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3275_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3275_Task6" name="Support corporate secretarial operations for board governance (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Support corporate secretarial operations for board governance (links to VS-36.1): prepare board/committee materials, manage meetings and minutes, resolutions and authorities (links to VS-36), corporate disclosures; coordinate with VS-36 corporate-governance value stream
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per meeting</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3275_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3275_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3275_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3275_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3275_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-531 (ensure controlled execution — Corporate Legal Advisory, Contracts &amp; Risk Governance (PA-100.3).) | - operational: corporate calendar; operational: single entity master (links to VS-29)
Owner: Corporate Secretary</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3275_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3275_Annotation8" targetRef="W3275_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
