    <bpmn:process id="W_W3276" name="W3276. Regulatory &amp; Government Investigation Defense" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Government investigation/subpoena/search warrant; regulatory inquiry
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: ~1–5 major investigations/year + numerous inquiries
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Participants: VP Legal &amp; Compliance, Litigation Counsel, Legal Ops Mgr, Compliance (links to VS-22), Business Owners, External Counsel, Authorities (BIR, DOLE, DENR, DTI, NPC, NBI, PNP, BOC, LGU, AMLC)
Source: workflow W3276 — Regulatory &amp; Government Investigation Defense</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3276_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3276_Lane1" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3276_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3276_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3276_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3276_Lane2" name="Litigation Counsel">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3276_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3276_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3276_Start4" name="Government investigation/subpoena/search warrant; regulatory inquiry">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3276_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3276_Task5" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance scope and coordinate response: assess authority/subject…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Legal &amp; Compliance scope and coordinate response: assess authority/subject (tax per VS-79, labor per VS-84, environment per VS-73/VS-25, consumer/DTI per VS-13, privacy/NPC per VS-91, AML/AMLC per VS-86, customs/BOC per VS-87, anti-bribery per VS-86.3), privileges and strategy, engagement of external counsel, internal investigation team; manage search-warrant execution (privilege, scope)
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / External Counsel
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per inquiry</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3276_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3276_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3276_Task6" name="Manage internal investigation and government response: preserve documents…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage internal investigation and government response: preserve documents (litigation hold W3262), conduct privileged investigation, respond to subpoenas/document requests (links to VS-88 e-discovery), manage witness interviews and government interactions; assess exposure and remediation
Responsible (R): Litigation Counsel / Compliance / External Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per inquiry</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3276_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3276_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3276_Task7" name="Resolve and remediate: negotiate settlement/consent order where warranted…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Resolve and remediate: negotiate settlement/consent order where warranted, manage penalties (links to VS-15), implement corrective actions and controls to prevent recurrence, update risk register (links to VS-21.2) and disclosures (W3277); capture lessons
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Compliance / Business Owners
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per inquiry</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3276_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3276_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3276_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3276_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
