      <bpmn:userTask id="W3277_Task5" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance/Risk maintain legal-risk register: contingent and pending…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Legal &amp; Compliance/Risk maintain legal-risk register: contingent and pending legal risks (litigation W3258, regulatory W3276, IP W3268, contract W3274, labor per VS-84, tax per VS-79), likelihood/impact assessment, owner, mitigation, status; integrate to enterprise risk register (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Risk
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3277_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3277_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3277_Task6" name="Finance/VP Legal &amp; Compliance assess and disclose loss contingencies per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/VP Legal &amp; Compliance assess and disclose loss contingencies per PFRS/IAS 37 (W3261): probable/possible/remote classification, accrue or disclose, contingency notes to financial statements, related-party and commitments disclosures; coordinate audit support (links to VS-22.2) and consolidation (links to VS-17.2)
Responsible (R): Finance / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Period-end</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3277_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3277_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3277_Task7" name="Report to board/audit committee (links to VS-36.1): legal-risk portfolio…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report to board/audit committee (links to VS-36.1): legal-risk portfolio, material contingencies, reserve movements, disclosures; obtain required oversight/approvals; manage material non-public information confidentiality
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Finance
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Period-end</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3277_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3277_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
