    <bpmn:process id="W_W3278" name="W3278. Ethics, Whistleblower &amp; Investigation Case Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Whistleblower report (via channel per VS-22.1); ethics concern; mandatory disclosure
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: ~20–80 reports/year
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Participants: VP Legal &amp; Compliance, Internal Audit (links to VS-21), Compliance (links to VS-22/VS-86.3), HR (links to VS-19/VS-84), Loss Prevention (links to VS-23), Investigations Team
Source: workflow W3278 — Ethics, Whistleblower &amp; Investigation Case Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3278_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3278_Lane1" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3278_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3278_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3278_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3278_Lane2" name="Investigations Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3278_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3278_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3278_Start4" name="Whistleblower report (via channel per VS-22.1); ethics concern; mandatory disclosure">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3278_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3278_Task5" name="Receive and triage reports: intake via whistleblower channel (anonymous-capable…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Receive and triage reports: intake via whistleblower channel (anonymous-capable per VS-22.1), log case with pseudonymous ID, protect reporter anonymity and anti-retaliation (per VS-22.1), triage by severity/credibility, assign investigator and privileged handling where legal-investigation warranted
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Compliance / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per report</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3278_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3278_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3278_Task6" name="Conduct investigation: plan scope, collect evidence (documents, data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Conduct investigation: plan scope, collect evidence (documents, data, interviews — links to VS-23.1 investigation methodology, CCTV per VS-23.2, system logs per VS-27.3), interview witnesses/subjects with due-process safeguards, coordinate with HR (employee discipline per VS-19/VS-84) and Loss Prevention (theft/fraud per VS-23); manage privileged internal investigation where exposure is material
Responsible (R): Investigations Team / Legal / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3278_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3278_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3278_Task7" name="Resolve and remediate: substantiated findings → disciplinary action (HR)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Resolve and remediate: substantiated findings → disciplinary action (HR), recovery (civil/criminal per W3257), regulatory self-disclosure where required (W3276), corrective actions and controls; close case with documentation; feed analytics (W3280) and risk register (links to VS-21.2); protect against retaliation
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / HR / Compliance
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3278_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3278_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3278_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3278_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
