        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-531 (ensure controlled execution — Corporate Legal Advisory, Contracts &amp; Risk Governance (PA-100.3).) | - operational: anti-retaliation policy and monitoring (per VS-22); operational: trained investigators and counsel oversight
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
